<h1>Appearance &amp; Themes</h1>
<p class="lead">Ten themes, light and dark, your own colours and font, and three layout styles — including Space Station mode with its floating dock and mobile tab bar.</p>

<h2>Themes</h2>
<p>Switch themes in <strong>Settings → Appearance</strong> (the first card on the page). The preference is saved to <code>localStorage</code> and takes effect immediately — no reload needed.</p>

<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Theme</th><th>Look</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><strong>Space</strong></td><td>Calm blue and teal (default)</td></tr>
